  <summary>Desktop client for 032 Music Server</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-only</project_license>
  <content_rating type="oars-1.1"/>
  <description>
    <p>A desktop music player for 032 Music Server, built on Feishin (GPL-3.0).</p>
    <p>Features</p>
    <ul>
      <li>MPV player backend with audio passthrough, exclusive mode and bit-perfect output</li>
      <li>032 Music Server support: works, series, daily mixes and playback history</li>
      <li>Synchronized and unsynchronized lyrics support</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
